      "description": "The meaning of the operation moves to the activity type https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/activity-type/area, linked by activityType (gp:activityType). The definition no longer defines the operation; it was: \"The area of this Surface, as measured in the spatial reference system of this Surface.\"",
