      "changeClassification": "clarifying",
      "description": "Corrects what https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/area/actions/tools-2026-11-09 describes: the description sections removed then (sources, illustrations, data formats, multiplicity and the open question where present, and the Register position reference to the tier-4 process and its testbed URL) are restored. Tools and testbed stay in the prose; decision D4 applies to the model (keywords, source, properties), which carries none. Decision of 2026-11-09.",
      "proposer": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/geolabs",
